query new_paid_to_date is:
    the new paid to date of which activity is which date.

query unapplied_amount is:
    the unapplied amount of which activity is which amount.

query checks is:
    which activity fails the check which code.

query policy_after_paid_to_date is:
    the paid to date of the policy after which activity is which value.

the view premium_payment is:
    the title is "PremiumPayment (termlife)".
    the case is a scenario.
    the facts about "the activity" are
        the effective date of an activity is a date,
        the amount of an activity is an amount.
    the facts about "the policy it finds" are
        the modal premium of the policy before an activity is an amount,
        the paid to date of the policy before an activity is a date,
        the billing mode of the policy before an activity is a value.
    the result is the answer to query new_paid_to_date.
    the answers to "which activity fails the check which code" are listed as "Checks".
    the result shows its citations.

